258
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:48,120
Add in a nuclear fallout of awkwardness, and it's the ninth circle of social hell.

259
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:53,960
Though, I ran into three on the way to the bathroom, and she was like, oh, hey, wow, long time no see.

260
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:56,240
It was a normal interaction, TBH.

261
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:58,540
No, no, no.

262
00:11:58,800 --> 00:11:59,980
No, it was not!

263
00:12:00,500 --> 00:12:01,120
That's a little...

264
